{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Hey Deborah, totally buzzing! Had a great night out last night - dinner, and drinks with my friends. So glad I got to let my hair down. You?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-76196433471d609c75d499ea", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:33.943320+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "76196433471d609c75d499ea", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "76196433471d609c75d499ea", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Sounds great, Jolene! I just visited this place and it was so calming. Nostalgic too."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-8cdfc9a6247afccb86adcf2c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:33.964950+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8cdfc9a6247afccb86adcf2c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8cdfc9a6247afccb86adcf2c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Wow, those flowers are beautiful! What type are they? It looks so peaceful there."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-c943d9ca969468d2ca5d4b48", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:33.977597+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c943d9ca969468d2ca5d4b48", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c943d9ca969468d2ca5d4b48", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: The roses and dahlias bring me peace. I lost a friend last week, so I've been spending time in the garden to find some comfort."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-63cc4cb12e466eb5a314f57c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:33.989010+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "63cc4cb12e466eb5a314f57c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "63cc4cb12e466eb5a314f57c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Sorry to hear about your friend, Deb. Losing someone can be really tough. How are you holding up?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-4ddd49aa85d228345515b559", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:34.002784+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4ddd49aa85d228345515b559", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4ddd49aa85d228345515b559", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Thanks for the kind words. It's been tough, but I'm comforted by remembering our time together. It reminds me of how special life is."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-46d103a1b60e0847a1b47772", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:34.008472+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "46d103a1b60e0847a1b47772", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "46d103a1b60e0847a1b47772", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Memories can give us so much comfort and joy."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-5b842383c931a72331c04e16", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:34.028774+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5b842383c931a72331c04e16", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5b842383c931a72331c04e16", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Memories keep our loved ones close. This is the last photo with Karlie which was taken last summer when we hiked. It was our last one. We had such a great time! Every time I see it, I can't help but smile."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-a8f2984a4d1e2c5aa56c56d6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:34.041234+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a8f2984a4d1e2c5aa56c56d6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a8f2984a4d1e2c5aa56c56d6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Wow, looks like a great trip! Where else have you traveled?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-5aa3096f7efeb10307c2c2e9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:34.064423+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5aa3096f7efeb10307c2c2e9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5aa3096f7efeb10307c2c2e9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: I've been blessed to travel to a few places and Bali last year was one of my favs. It was a gorgeous island that gave me peace, great for yoga."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-fc062681d2120e2483f65d09", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:34.075423+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fc062681d2120e2483f65d09", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fc062681d2120e2483f65d09", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Wow, that's great! Is yoga on the beach a thing? I've been wanting to try it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-c25d5f595eb60dd94d6c9513", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:34.085859+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c25d5f595eb60dd94d6c9513", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c25d5f595eb60dd94d6c9513", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: The sound of the waves and the fresh air is wonderful!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-3770f8ac5f49ad4d493c5004", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:34.100089+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3770f8ac5f49ad4d493c5004", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3770f8ac5f49ad4d493c5004", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I'll definitely give it a go! It sounds peaceful. Thanks!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-b66ccb61e2ced9f5495033bd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:34.102155+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b66ccb61e2ced9f5495033bd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b66ccb61e2ced9f5495033bd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Let me know how it goes. Enjoy it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-9da4e3e2bbdc990ca593a709", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:34.119883+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9da4e3e2bbdc990ca593a709", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9da4e3e2bbdc990ca593a709", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I'll keep you posted if I decide to go there."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-bab2b69b6057e3750a546c9f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:34.129780+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bab2b69b6057e3750a546c9f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bab2b69b6057e3750a546c9f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Take care!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-48/session_6-b290c3c88d551e14a6df903d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:54:34.139862+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b290c3c88d551e14a6df903d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b290c3c88d551e14a6df903d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
